('11111111-1111-1111-1111-200000000002', '11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111', 'Product QA', 'Global', 'Branding', 'Brand color system enforces dark charcoal + electric-blue palette', 'Validate that surface, text, and accent colors strictly follow the approved CSS custom property tokens.', 'No raw hex colors outside the approved design token set anywhere in the shipped bundle.', '["Background uses --color-background", "Accent uses --color-primary", "No inline hex colors detected by linter"]', 'Visual Spec', 'Automated', 'Medium', 'Passed', 'Token linter passing on latest build.', true, now() - interval '8 days'),
('11111111-1111-1111-1111-200000000003', '11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111', 'Product QA', 'Global', 'Accessibility', 'Platform-wide WCAG 2.1 AA contrast compliance', 'Run an automated contrast scan across all primary templates (feed, profile, upload, messaging).', 'All text and interactive elements meet a minimum 4.5:1 contrast ratio.', '["Body text >= 4.5:1", "Large headings >= 3:1", "Focus rings visible on dark surfaces"]', 'A11y Audit', 'Automated', 'Critical', 'In Progress', 'Two contrast violations remain on the messaging panel.', true, now() - interval '7 days'),
('11111111-1111-1111-1111-200000000004', '11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111', 'Product QA', 'Global', 'User Experience', 'Onboarding flow clearly separates Creator vs Recruiter account paths', 'A reviewer walks through fresh sign-up as both a Creator and a Recruiter and evaluates whether the branching choice and resulting setup steps feel intuitive.', 'A first-time user immediately understands which path to choose and is not shown irrelevant setup steps for the other persona.', '["Persona choice is presented before any setup steps", "No dead-end screens", "Copy avoids jargon"]', 'UX Review', 'Human Review', 'High', 'Not Started', '', true, now() - interval '7 days'),
