('11111111-1111-1111-1111-200000000015', '11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111', 'Component QA', 'Global Navigation', 'Navigation', 'Top nav dropdown menu keyboard navigable', 'Verify the account dropdown menu can be fully operated via keyboard.', 'Tab, Arrow, Enter, and Escape keys operate the dropdown per standard menu patterns.', '["Enter opens menu", "Arrow keys move focus between items", "Escape closes and returns focus to trigger"]', 'A11y Audit', 'Automated', 'Medium', 'Passed', '', true, now() - interval '8 days'),
('11111111-1111-1111-1111-200000000016', '11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111', 'Component QA', 'Explore Feed', 'User Experience', 'Portfolio card hover reveals like/comment/view stats', 'A reviewer checks whether the hover-reveal stats overlay feels responsive and legible over varied thumbnail imagery.', 'Stats overlay appears within 100ms of hover and remains legible against light and dark thumbnails.', '["Overlay appears within 100ms", "Legible over both light & dark images", "Touch devices show stats without hover"]', 'UX Review', 'Human Review', 'Low', 'Not Started', '', true, now() - interval '7 days'),
('11111111-1111-1111-1111-200000000017', '11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111', 'Component QA', 'Project Detail', 'Functionality', 'Image lightbox component supports pinch-zoom on touch devices', 'Verify the lightbox gallery viewer supports pinch-to-zoom and swipe navigation on touch devices.', 'Pinch gesture zooms smoothly up to 3x; swipe navigates to next/previous image.', '["Pinch zoom up to 3x", "Swipe navigates images", "Double-tap resets zoom"]', 'Interaction Spec', 'Automated', 'High', 'In Progress', 'Swipe navigation implemented; pinch-zoom still pending.', true, now() - interval '6 days'),
('11111111-1111-1111-1111-200000000018', '11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111', 'Component QA', 'Project Detail', 'Accessibility', 'Like button component exposes accessible name for screen readers', 'Verify the like button announces its state (liked/not liked) and count to assistive tech.', 'Screen reader announces "Like, 42 likes, not pressed" or equivalent pressed state.', '["aria-pressed reflects state", "Accessible name includes count", "Focus visible on keyboard nav"]', 'A11y Audit', 'Automated', 'Medium', 'Passed', '', true, now() - interval '6 days'),
('11111111-1111-1111-1111-200000000019', '11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111', 'Component QA', 'Explore Feed', 'Branding', 'Skeleton loading shimmer matches brand gradient tokens', 'Validate the loading skeleton shimmer animation uses the approved gradient tokens rather than generic gray.', 'Shimmer gradient uses --color-surface-container tokens and animates at the standard 1.4s cycle.', '["Uses approved gradient tokens", "1.4s animation cycle", "No layout shift on content swap"]', 'Visual Spec', 'Automated', 'Low', 'Passed', '', true, now() - interval '5 days'),
('11111111-1111-1111-1111-200000000020', '11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111', 'Component QA', 'Project Detail', 'Functionality', 'Comment input component prevents empty submissions', 'Verify the comment box disables the submit action for whitespace-only input.', 'Submit button is disabled until at least one non-whitespace character is entered.', '["Whitespace-only rejected", "Submit disabled state styled distinctly", "Character limit enforced at 500"]', 'Functional Spec', 'Automated', 'Medium', 'Failed', 'Whitespace-only comments currently post successfully.', true, now() - interval '4 days'),
('11111111-1111-1111-1111-200000000021', '11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111', 'Component QA', 'Upload Wizard', 'User Experience', 'File dropzone component gives clear drag-over visual feedback', 'A reviewer drags files over the dropzone to assess whether the hover/active states feel responsive and clear.', 'Dropzone border and background visibly change within one animation frame of drag-enter, and revert cleanly on drag-leave.', '["Visual change on drag-enter", "Reverts on drag-leave", "Works with multi-file drag"]', 'UX Review', 'Human Review', 'Medium', 'Not Started', '', true, now() - interval '3 days'),
