('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000001', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Product QA', 'Global', 'Navigation', 'Sidebar navigation groups Classes, Attendance, Reports for teacher workflows', 'Verify the sidebar organizes core teacher tasks into clear, discoverable groups.', 'Classes, Attendance, and Reports are grouped and reachable within one click from any screen.', '["All groups reachable in 1 click", "Active section highlighted", "Sidebar collapses cleanly on tablet"]', 'UX Review', 'Automated', 'High', 'Passed', '', true, now() - interval '5 days'),
