('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000003', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Product QA', 'Global', 'Accessibility', 'Full app meets WCAG 2.1 AA for low-vision teacher users', 'Run an automated contrast and text-scaling scan across all primary teacher-facing templates.', 'All text meets 4.5:1 contrast and remains legible at 200% browser zoom without horizontal scroll.', '["Text contrast >= 4.5:1", "Legible at 200% zoom", "No horizontal scroll at 200% zoom"]', 'A11y Audit', 'Automated', 'Critical', 'In Progress', 'Zoom test reveals overflow on the Take Attendance grid.', true, now() - interval '5 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000004', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Product QA', 'Global', 'User Experience', 'New teacher onboarding explains attendance marking in under 3 steps', 'A reviewer completes first-time onboarding as a new teacher account and evaluates clarity and length.', 'A first-time teacher understands how to mark attendance within 3 onboarding steps or fewer, with no confusion observed.', '["3 steps or fewer", "No jargon in copy", "Skip option available"]', 'UX Review', 'Human Review', 'High', 'Not Started', '', true, now() - interval '4 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000005', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Product QA', 'Global', 'Functionality', 'Attendance data syncs reliably across offline/online transitions', 'Verify attendance marked while offline correctly syncs once connectivity is restored, without data loss or duplication.', 'Offline-marked attendance queues locally and syncs exactly once when connectivity returns.', '["No data loss when offline", "No duplicate records on reconnect", "Sync status indicator shown to teacher"]', 'Functional Spec', 'Automated', 'Critical', 'Failed', 'Duplicate attendance rows observed after reconnect in 2 of 10 test runs.', true, now() - interval '4 days'),
