('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000009', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Page QA', 'Take Attendance', 'Functionality', 'Take Attendance page defaults all students to Present for quick marking', 'Verify the daily attendance screen pre-marks all students Present, requiring teachers to only toggle exceptions.', 'All students default to Present on page load; teacher only needs to tap exceptions (Absent/Late).', '["All default to Present", "One-tap toggle to Absent/Late", "Default respects prior manual override same day"]', 'Functional Spec', 'Automated', 'High', 'Passed', '', true, now() - interval '5 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000010', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Page QA', 'Attendance History', 'Content', 'Attendance history page displays monthly calendar heatmap per student', 'Verify the history view renders a color-coded monthly calendar reflecting each day''s attendance status.', 'Calendar heatmap correctly color-codes Present/Absent/Late per day and supports month navigation.', '["Colors map correctly to status", "Month navigation works", "Weekends/holidays visually excluded"]', 'Functional Spec', 'Automated', 'Medium', 'In Progress', 'Holiday exclusion styling not yet implemented.', true, now() - interval '4 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000011', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Page QA', 'Reports', 'Functionality', 'Reports page exports attendance summary as PDF and CSV', 'Verify the reports screen can export the current filtered view in both PDF and CSV formats.', 'Both export formats generate correctly and reflect any active filters (date range, class).', '["PDF export matches on-screen data", "CSV export matches on-screen data", "Filters respected in both exports"]', 'Functional Spec', 'Automated', 'High', 'Not Started', '', true, now() - interval '4 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000012', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Page QA', 'Student Profile', 'User Experience', 'Student profile page surfaces attendance percentage prominently', 'A reviewer evaluates whether a teacher can immediately gauge a student''s attendance standing from the profile page.', 'Attendance percentage is visible without scrolling and its color communicates status (good/at-risk) at a glance.', '["Percentage visible above the fold", "Color communicates status", "At-risk threshold clearly indicated"]', 'UX Review', 'Human Review', 'Medium', 'Not Started', '', true, now() - interval '3 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000013', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Page QA', 'Parent Notifications', 'Functionality', 'Parent notification page sends SMS alert on 3 consecutive absences', 'Verify the system automatically triggers an SMS alert to the registered guardian after 3 consecutive unexcused absences.', 'SMS is sent within 1 hour of the 3rd consecutive absence being recorded, to the correct guardian contact.', '["Triggers exactly on 3rd consecutive absence", "Sent within 1 hour", "Correct guardian contact used"]', 'Integration Test', 'Automated', 'Critical', 'Failed', 'Alert occasionally fires on the 2nd absence; off-by-one bug logged.', true, now() - interval '3 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000014', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Page QA', 'Login', 'Accessibility', 'Login page form fields are screen-reader labeled and tab-orderable', 'Run an automated accessibility scan on the login form.', 'Username and password fields have programmatic labels and a logical tab order ending at the submit button.', '["Fields have programmatic labels", "Tab order logical", "Error messages announced via aria-live"]', 'A11y Audit', 'Automated', 'Medium', 'Passed', '', true, now() - interval '2 days'),
-- Component QA
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000015', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Component QA', 'Take Attendance', 'Functionality', 'Attendance toggle button cycles Present/Absent/Late with single tap', 'Verify the per-student status control cycles through the three states with a single tap and updates instantly.', 'Single tap cycles Present → Absent → Late → Present with immediate visual feedback.', '["Cycles all 3 states", "Updates instantly (no lag)", "State persists on scroll away/back"]', 'Interaction Spec', 'Automated', 'High', 'Passed', '', true, now() - interval '5 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000016', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Component QA', 'Take Attendance', 'User Experience', 'Student avatar list scrolls smoothly with sticky class header', 'Verify the class header (name, date, count) remains visible while the student list scrolls beneath it.', 'Header stays pinned during scroll with no flicker or overlap with list items.', '["Header remains pinned", "No flicker during scroll", "No overlap with list content"]', 'Interaction Spec', 'Automated', 'Low', 'Passed', '', true, now() - interval '4 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000017', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Component QA', 'Take Attendance', 'Accessibility', 'Attendance status icons include text labels, not color alone', 'Verify status indicators are distinguishable without relying solely on color.', 'Each status icon includes a text label or distinct shape, satisfying WCAG 1.4.1 (use of color).', '["Text label present per icon", "Distinguishable in grayscale", "Screen reader announces status name"]', 'A11y Audit', 'Automated', 'Critical', 'In Progress', 'Icons distinct in grayscale; screen reader announcement still generic.', true, now() - interval '4 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000018', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Component QA', 'Attendance History', 'Functionality', 'Calendar heatmap component correctly highlights holidays as excluded', 'Verify days configured as school holidays render as excluded (non-attendance) rather than absent.', 'Holiday dates render in a neutral "excluded" style and are omitted from attendance percentage calculations.', '["Holiday dates styled neutrally", "Excluded from percentage calc", "Configurable via admin calendar"]', 'Functional Spec', 'Automated', 'Medium', 'Passed', '', true, now() - interval '3 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000019', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Component QA', 'Take Attendance', 'User Experience', 'Bulk-mark-all-present component includes confirmation before applying', 'A reviewer tests the "Mark All Present" shortcut to confirm it cannot be triggered accidentally.', 'A confirmation step is required before the bulk action overwrites any manually-set statuses.', '["Confirmation required before applying", "Manually-set statuses called out in confirmation", "Undo available for 5 seconds after applying"]', 'UX Review', 'Human Review', 'Medium', 'Not Started', '', true, now() - interval '2 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000020', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Component QA', 'Class Roster', 'Functionality', 'Search-student component filters roster in real time as typed', 'Verify the roster search box filters the visible list on each keystroke without a submit action.', 'List filters within 150ms of each keystroke, matching name substrings case-insensitively.', '["Filters within 150ms per keystroke", "Case-insensitive matching", "Clear button resets filter"]', 'Interaction Spec', 'Automated', 'Medium', 'Passed', '', true, now() - interval '2 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000021', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Component QA', 'Student Profile', 'Branding', 'Progress ring component (attendance %) uses consistent color thresholds', 'Validate the attendance percentage ring uses the same green/amber/red thresholds everywhere it appears.', 'Thresholds (e.g. 90%+ green, 75-89% amber, <75% red) match across profile, roster, and reports.', '["Thresholds match design spec", "Consistent across all screens it appears on", "Colorblind-safe palette used"]', 'Visual Spec', 'Automated', 'Low', 'Failed', 'Reports view uses a different amber threshold (80% vs 75%) than profile.', true, now() - interval '1 day'),
-- Feature QA
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000022', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Feature QA', 'Class Roster', 'Functionality', 'Bulk attendance import feature parses CSV class rosters correctly', 'Verify a teacher can import an existing class roster via CSV with correct column mapping.', 'CSV import correctly maps name, ID, and contact columns, and flags malformed rows without failing the whole import.', '["Correct column mapping", "Malformed rows flagged, not silently dropped", "Duplicate student detection on import"]', 'Functional Spec', 'Automated', 'High', 'In Progress', 'Column mapping works; duplicate detection not yet implemented.', true, now() - interval '5 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000023', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Feature QA', 'Parent Notifications', 'Functionality', 'Automated absence-alert feature triggers parent SMS/email correctly', 'Verify the notification engine selects the correct channel (SMS/email) per guardian preference and sends accurate content.', 'Correct channel used per preference; message content includes student name, date, and absence count.', '["Correct channel per preference", "Message includes student name & date", "Delivery failures retried once"]', 'Integration Test', 'Automated', 'Critical', 'Failed', 'Email channel occasionally used even when SMS is the stated preference.', true, now() - interval '4 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000024', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Feature QA', 'Class Roster', 'User Experience', 'Substitute-teacher mode feature grants temporary limited class access', 'A reviewer evaluates whether a substitute teacher can be granted quick, clearly-scoped, time-limited access to a single class.', 'Access grant flow takes under 1 minute, clearly states scope and expiry, and substitute cannot access other classes or settings.', '["Grant flow under 1 minute", "Scope & expiry clearly stated", "No access outside granted class"]', 'UX Review', 'Human Review', 'High', 'Not Started', '', true, now() - interval '4 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000025', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Feature QA', 'Reports', 'Functionality', 'Monthly report generation feature aggregates data across all sections', 'Verify the monthly report correctly aggregates attendance across multiple class sections taught by one teacher.', 'Report totals match the sum of individual section totals, with no double-counting of shared students.', '["Totals match sum of sections", "No double-counting", "Report generation completes under 10s"]', 'Functional Spec', 'Automated', 'Medium', 'Passed', '', true, now() - interval '3 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000026', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Feature QA', 'Student Profile', 'Content', 'Leave-request feature lets students/parents submit excused absence notes', 'A reviewer submits a sample excused-absence note as a parent and evaluates the teacher-side review experience.', 'Note submission is simple for a parent, and the teacher can approve/deny with a visible reason trail.', '["Simple parent-side submission", "Teacher sees clear approve/deny action", "Reason trail preserved after decision"]', 'UX Review', 'Human Review', 'Medium', 'Not Started', '', true, now() - interval '3 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000027', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Feature QA', 'Class Roster', 'Functionality', 'Multi-class scheduling feature prevents overlapping attendance sessions', 'Verify the system blocks a teacher from opening two attendance sessions for overlapping class times.', 'Attempting to start an overlapping session shows a clear conflict warning and blocks the action.', '["Conflict detected correctly", "Clear warning message shown", "Action blocked until resolved"]', 'Functional Spec', 'Automated', 'High', 'Skipped', 'Deprioritized pending multi-section scheduling redesign.', true, now() - interval '2 days'),
('22222222-2222-2222-2222-200000000028', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Feature QA', 'Reports', 'User Experience', 'Dashboard analytics feature flags at-risk students below 75% attendance', 'A reviewer checks whether the at-risk student list is easy to find and act on from the teacher dashboard.', 'At-risk students (under 75% attendance) are surfaced in a dedicated, sortable list with one-click drill-down to their profile.', '["At-risk list clearly labeled", "Sortable by attendance %", "One-click drill-down to profile"]', 'UX Review', 'Human Review', 'Critical', 'Not Started', '', true, now() - interval '1 day'),
